'''Red Thornleaf''' is an {{Uncommon}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Red Thornleaves''' can be obtained from breaking [[Dead Bush|Dead Bushes]] in the {{Zone|Burning Desert}} or {{Zone|Dragontail}} with a {{Item|Thornleaf Scythe}}.

== Usage ==
=== Purchase ===
{{Item|Red Thornleaf Tea}} can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Grog}} in {{zone|Dragontail}}.
