'''Red Thornleaf''' can be also used as [[Machine Fuel]], adding 200 Fuel.

== Trivia ==
*Due to being a {{Item|Dead Bush}}, the block version of the '''Red Thornleaf''' can be right-clicked with {{Item|Enchanted Bone Meal}} to grant {{Item|Dead Seed|amount=1}} whilst the {{NPCSprite|Tyashoi Alchemist}} is in the {{zone|Village}}.
*'''Red Thornleaf''' is not affected by {{stat|FMF}}, unlike {{Item|Mushroom Spore}}s.
